[gd_resource type="StandardMaterial3D" format=3]

; A hinged door LEAF (PLAN.md 3.18l, user: "most doors should be sliding glass; the few hinged ones should be
; white or wood, not grey with aged red"). The kit's leaf wears MI_Trim_MetalConcrete, which is the wall's
; material -- so a door read as a panel of the wall. This is the same neutral concrete/metal texture (it carries
; the leaf's own panel relief in its normal map) tinted to a wooden door, for the older buildings that still have one.
